        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "beacon.enabledAfterRecovery"
        },
        {
          "equals": true,
          "observation": "beacon.recoveryWithoutReload"
        },
        {
          "equals": 1,
          "observation": "beacon.instanceCountAfterRecovery"
        },
        {
          "equals": 0,
          "observation": "beacon.duplicateCallbackCountAfterRecovery"
        }
      ],
      "id": "beacon-missing-target-suppresses-only-beacon",
      "prerequisites": [
        "两个门槛任务均为 Completed。",
        "当前为布道日且原生 sermon_ready >= 1（Ready 状态）。",
        "测试设施可受控使教堂目标点不可用。",
        "信标开关为开启。"
      ],
      "profileId": "church-beacon",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-12"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "注入教堂目标点不可用；预期仅信标依赖被停用；检查 beacon.targetAvailableBeforeRecovery=false 与 beacon.enabledBeforeRecovery=false。",
        "核对角落 Ready 文字与业务状态；预期保留可读 Ready 且不显示信标；检查 state.readable=true、state.sermonReadyValue>=1、hud.visible=true 与 hud.textKey=gksr.hud.sermonReminder。",
        "解除故障但不读档不重启；预期信标自动恢复；检查 beacon.targetAvailableAfterRecovery=true、beacon.enabledAfterRecovery=true 与 beacon.recoveryWithoutReload=true。",
        "统计恢复后实例与回调；预期单一无重复；检查 beacon.instanceCountAfterRecovery=1 与 beacon.duplicateCallbackCountAfterRecovery=0。"
      ],
      "title": "目标点不可用时只停用信标并保留 Ready 文字与业务状态"
    },
